      "content": "That's a good start on the tone. I like the bit about textural maximalism.\n\nCould you expand this into a more detailed breakdown? I specifically need a section on \"Materiality and Tactile Shifts\" and another on \"The Evolution of the Silhouette.\" \n\nJust a reminder: the SEO team is really strict about that brand density score. Like I said before, don't make it a keyword dump—I want actual substance—but for the piece to even show up in the discovery feeds, that density score needs to be at a respectable level. Try to weave the brand context in naturally as part of your analysis, but don't let the metric swallow the actual writing.",
